<div class="alert alert-warning alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center shadow-sm mb-2" role="alert">
    <i class="mdi mdi-alert-decagram-outline fs-4 me-2 text-warning"></i>
    <div>
        <strong>Transfer Request Notice:</strong> This action only submits a <u>request</u>. Member account balances will <strong>not</strong> be affected until <strong>validation</strong> is completed by the authorized control unit.
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
</div>

<div class="row mb-2">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card border-info shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-header bg-light text-primary fw-bold d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <span>
                    <i class="mdi mdi-information-outline me-2"></i> Account Transfer Guidelines
                </span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#transferGuidelinesBody">
                    <i class="mdi mdi-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div id="transferGuidelinesBody" class="collapse">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <ul class="mb-3 list-unstyled">
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-checkbox-marked-circle-outline text-success me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Transfer Request:</strong> This does <u>not</u> affect member balances until validation is completed.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-account-arrow-right-outline text-info me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Sender Account:</strong> Select only one source account and ensure the amount is within available balance.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-account-search-outline text-primary me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Receiver Account:</strong> Use the receiver’s reference number to search and select their valid destination account.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-comment-edit-outline text-secondary me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Note:</strong> You may provide a reason for the transfer. The system appends accountant name and timestamp automatically.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-currency-usd text-warning me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Transfer Fees:</strong> If applicable, fees will be captured separately and included in total for audit purposes.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-alert-octagram-outline text-danger me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Important:</strong> Transactions require supervisor or system validation before impacting any account.
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-2">
                            <i class="mdi mdi-shield-lock-outline text-success me-2"></i>
                            <strong>Irreversible:</strong> Once validated, this operation is final. Always double-check sender, receiver, and amounts.
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr />

                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                        <i class="mdi mdi-help-circle-outline me-2"></i>
                        For mistakes or corrections, contact your audit/control unit before validation is finalized.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
